{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban the construction of new AI data centres",
        "additional_details": "We believe their vast demand for water and electricity, contribution to greenhouse gas emissions and continuous industrial noise place an unacceptable burden on communities, wildlife and finite natural resources. We are concerned that expanding this infrastructure risks undermining the UK\u2019s legally binding net zero commitments. The Government should act in the public\u2019s interest by implementing this ban and preventing any avoidable environmental harm before it occurs.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to implement an immediate ban on the construction of any new AI data centres, including approved ones, to protect our people, wildlife, water resources, and environment from the significant and growing impacts of these centres.",
